; caldera_open_crater.room - the crater open to the sky, the Caldera's bench at its floor (design 04 section 3.7).
; No gate: the main path crosses at row 33 over the cap (cols 18-21); single jumps climb out of the bench pit.
; Above the exits the crater is open air to its rim, with no ledges (WORLD-25), and no roof: row 0 opens to the sky (WORLD-28).

